+    @Comment("How many redstone lamps may switch on or off in one tick. A lamp gives no signal, so\n" +
+            "when it changes makes no difference to a circuit; what it costs is relighting the\n" +
+            "blocks around it. A map whose street lamps hang off a daylight detector switches all of\n" +
